{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026N8SXUpRwDT1794358581.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p><strong>加息預期升溫</strong>　<strong>港股料低開約百點</strong> </p><p>加息預期升溫，港股料低開約百點。美股回軟，輝達跌5%，見七個月低；AMD升1%，三連升；CoreWeave盤後升5%。</p><p></p><p><strong>通脹高過預期</strong>　<strong>債息重上五厘</strong> </p><p>美國上月通脹按月升0.4%，高過預期。儲局官員籲加半厘或加兩次息。10年期債息重上五厘。</p><p></p><p><strong>Anthropic開始招股</strong>　<strong>料下周四上市</strong> </p><p>Anthropic開始招股，料下周四上市。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.903008+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:15.940819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:38.421419+00:00","content_hash":"69705b85838edf191b35f674e9bc535f728ede9ec1173f181388def218cb5330","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.903008+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}